{"agent":"ph-perf2","data":{"by":"Qwen/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-FP8","evidence":{"chunk_findings":[{"chunk":2,"detail":"The new share tests are vacuous for the denominator that matters. `ci_log()` creates only `passed` and `partial` outcomes, so `pass_rate=0.1` and `partial_rate=0.9` would also be produced by an implementation that normalizes only over `passed + partial` instead of over all gate outcomes. The stated failure case is a `ci` gate that also has failure, skip, and unavailable outcomes, where the intended pass/partial shares are not 10%/90%. For example, with 1 passed, 9 partial, and 10 failed ci outcomes, correct shares are 5% and 45%, but a `passed/(passed+partial)` bug still returns 10% and 90% and this test passes. The same weakness applies to `test_summary_text_carries_pass_and_partial`, which reuses the same two-verdict fixture.","digest":"229dd7c7fc4041d3","family":"alibaba","location":"tests/test_metrics_outcome_shares.py:42","malformed":"","reviewer":"[REDACTED:name]","severity":"MEDIUM","title":"tests/test_metrics_outcome_shares.py:42"}],"chunks_total":2,"combined_gates":["rubber_duck","critic"],"coverage":"2/2 chunk(s) reviewed","delta_rounds":0,"diff_chars":5553,"diff_sha":"000ba803db5081f762b173471eb9b24b007bf06b98545fa70c592f751fdb5824","diff_source":"main..HEAD + tracked working-tree changes in $HOME/src/ddflow/.ddflow/worktrees/WF-metrics-pass-partial-share","diff_stat":{"deletions":0,"files":0,"insertions":0,"untracked":0},"elapsed_s":206.5,"family":"alibaba","findings":1,"max_chunk_chars":5000,"model":"[REDACTED:name]","output_digest":"669fefa598cae5fa","output_file":".ddflow/local/reviews/WF-metrics-pass-partial-share.rubber_duck.[REDACTED:name].20261114T093559Z-41e26ad0.jsonl","reason":"","review_degraded":[{"at":1794649167.378495,"family":"xai","gate":"rubber_duck","model":"grok-4.7","reason":"HTTP 403","reviewer":"grok-4.7"}],"review_id":"acac9156cc06","review_kind":"full","reviewed":[1,2],"reviewed_head":"b336e0aab5fa625e9c2dab2f138e2eaff